{
  "schemaVersion": "1.0",
  "id": "e-no-longer-not-any-longer",
  "lexicon": "zkv",
  "number": 238,
  "kind": "phrase",
  "headword": "no longer/not…any longer",
  "star": true,
  "senses": [
    {
      "zh": "不再"
    }
  ],
  "examples": [
    {
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "Tom, you are "
        },
        {
          "t": "underline",
          "v": "no longer"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " a little boy. You should learn to be independent."
        },
        {
          "t": "br"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "= Tom, you are "
        },
        {
          "t": "underline",
          "v": "not"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " a little boy "
        },
        {
          "t": "underline",
          "v": "any longer"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": ". You should learn to be independent."
        }
      ],
      "zh": "汤姆，你不再是一个小男孩了。你应该学会独立。"
    }
  ],
  "tip": [
    {
      "id": "p1",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "no longer/not…any longer 是常考词组，常出现在保持句意基本不变的句型转换练习中，所以学生一定要知道：no longer/not…any longer 暗含“过去曾是”used to be 的意思，在句中可以互换。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p2",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "例如：Shanghai is "
        },
        {
          "t": "underline",
          "v": "not"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " a small fishing village "
        },
        {
          "t": "underline",
          "v": "any longer"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "."
        },
        {
          "t": "br"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "= Shanghai "
        },
        {
          "t": "underline",
          "v": "used to be"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " a small fishing village."
        },
        {
          "t": "br"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "上海再也不是一个小渔村了。"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
